    <string name="saga_admin">What my admin can see</string>
    <string name="saga_admin_1">Your admin runs this server. Technically they can read everything stored on it – including your pages, tasks and events, your jobs and your conversation with %1$s while it is stored.</string>
    <string name="saga_admin_2">Your chats are end-to-end encrypted – they can\'t read those. Exception: messages in which you call the AI in a chat go to the AI in plain text.</string>
    <string name="saga_admin_3">In the admin area they only see numbers (requests per day), no content; on servers with fewer than 5 accounts only totals.</string>
    <string name="saga_admin_4">What you give %1$s is also seen by the service that runs the AI: %2$s.</string>
